{"id": "b0b4be888f56a0d62df41845111567502fffdfeb22860afba421e64d7e502e1b", "original": "/2c인페르노 지하채굴장.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "/2c因弗诺地下矿场。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -4111411928412129998, "path": ["TextList", 10, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 90, "ops", 9, "value"], "target": "/2cInferno. Underground Mine.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "ed5fe3a5833f7e714b7c88bf4d485315f914cb6093a035c1a7214d76fdbc796a", "original": "이봐들, 좀 더 힘들 내라구. 이제 사이럽스까지 얼마 남지 않았어.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "各位，再加把劲，离赛勒普斯已经不远了。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 0, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 0, "value"], "target": "Come on, everyone. Keep going. We're almost at Cyrups.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "d907eb49ec11700b3d3789c6171ae13813bf9fef8acb9a7cba14499b5d86a805", "original": "어이, 새로온 친구. 트리시스 사막은 초행길이라고 했던가?", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "喂，新来的朋友，你说过这是第一次走特里西斯沙漠吧？", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 1, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 1, "value"], "target": "Hey, new fellow. Did you say this was your first time crossing the Trisis Desert?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "ae5b3beb34bf34b9f645987de5d609a931fef670c4b1d9dedf0f0557701c7c20", "original": "그렇소이다.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "是的。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 2, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 2, "value"], "target": "That's right.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "d06ec5222fa97d2e76283dbe95d99f242351a81c84f7462bdd4b5d4e548dc44f", "original": "후후, 트리시스 횡단 장사는 빈손으로 시작해서 가장 크게 돈을 벌 수 있는 길이지만 사막에 처음인 사람은 죽기 딱 좋은 방법이기도 하지.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呵呵，横穿特里西斯做生意，是白手起家赚大钱的好路子，可对初入沙漠的人来说，也是最容易送命的办法。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 3, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 3, "value"], "target": "Heh, trading across Trisis is the best way to make a fortune starting with nothing. But it's also a fine way to get yourself killed if you're new to the desert.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "1404e2db66db3e43b5928aaf609892e3c3f43eb4821e30d03351b56e211b1975", "original": "자네는 운이 좋았어, 우리 같은 동료를 만날 수 있었으니 말이야.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "你运气不错，能遇到我们这样的同伴。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 4, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 4, "value"], "target": "You're lucky you found companions like us.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "81c63fde263b6ff60fec40221f42fc0e60c29b381995a5b629f15aee2262ce67", "original": "쓸데 없는 말로 힘을 낭비하지 말어! 만약 사막 도적들이라도 만난다면 죽을 힘을 다해 뛰어야 할테니 힘을 비축하라구.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "别说废话浪费力气了！万一遇到沙漠盗贼，还得拼命逃跑，省点力气吧。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 5, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 5, "value"], "target": "Don't waste your strength on idle chatter! Save it in case we run into desert bandits. You'll have to run for your life.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "bb179ec7e392eb01d7d53582d8ae4c4ae29251427ff87e1e4f890b0a5313537e", "original": "사막 도적이라...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "沙漠盗贼啊……", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 6, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 6, "value"], "target": "Desert bandits...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "d8cd202e20f879cdb6329b6133772bcf6fe11f5e5ae730eb5024c6be4739a53e", "original": "으악!!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呜啊！！！", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 7, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 7, "value"], "target": "Aaargh!!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "733366afa050a14f90c228944fea3ffe69dae8841a425e53ed3e7995b5ae0eba", "original": "도적떼다!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "是盗贼！！", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 9, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 8, "value"], "target": "Bandits!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "f8256b0b67b0cd6a2805452e18625316b719190e2a1b975f4b6bb922142d95f8", "original": "도망가자!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "快逃！！", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 10, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 9, "value"], "target": "Run!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "339bb81d7b55ce6df92441b8794c63cfa76cbc3f24f31d911e4ee2a6d91a7c12", "original": "이런... 도적떼는 떨쳐 버렸지만 동행을 잃어 버렸군.../30d 이제 어디로 가야하는 건지...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "糟了……虽然甩掉了盗贼，却和同行的人走散了……/30d接下来该往哪儿走……", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 11, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 10, "value"], "target": "Damn... I lost the bandits, but I've lost my companions too.../30d Where do I go now...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "180a2386d0006d901ed36cd5f89fea71fa3cf8f8b9c85dddf892b86beab991a1", "original": "사이럽스는 남동쪽일텐데./30d 얼마 안남았다고 했으니 일단 걸어 보는 수밖에 없겠군.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "赛勒普斯应该在东南方。/30d他们说已经不远了，只能先走走看。", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 12, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 11, "value"], "target": "Cyrups should be to the southeast./30d They said it wasn't far. I'll just have to keep walking.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "8e0d70c31217cb3208688829f9a0a3aac3577e6061f0cfcdc78c42e23be57461", "original": "으음... 더 이상은 도저히.../30d 여기가 한계인가...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "唔……实在走不动了……/30d到此为止了吗……", "object_name": "art_ko_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 8608445169955349550, "path": ["TextList", 13, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 317, "ops", 12, "value"], "target": "Ugh... I can't go any farther.../30d Is this the end...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "35cbd28c8e2173f324931380d97400531238448f12ce8d2bd5bdd6323a931dfc", "original": "/2c인페르노 지하채굴장.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "/2c因弗诺地下矿场。", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 0, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 0, "value"], "target": "/2cInferno. Underground Mine.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "84a31b64c32f64a18c7305b526950d54fca6b7ced633febe4bd915950770bf24", "original": "으...나를 집으로 보내줘...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呃……让我回家……", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 1, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 1, "value"], "target": "Ugh... Let me go home...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "c9bd461e107ada13461a7977d4b8fece05b54d3bec3682d2c387eb0f288b9a9c", "original": "뭐지..? /n이 이상한 진동은...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "怎么回事……？/n这奇怪的震动……", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 4, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 3, "value"], "target": "What...? /nWhat's that strange rumbling...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "e50d53437f682229c98cff8fce6454342d64faad55c74f10fc633980432cbd17", "original": "큰일이다!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "不好了！", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 5, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 4, "value"], "target": "We're in trouble!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "25364b8f39d63a051fe9c65f236b6bd41805e083357970ff16e2f6ac52ba2fbc", "original": "동굴이...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "洞穴……", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 6, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 5, "value"], "target": "The cave...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "8f733b32dcaa067b4c522bd3b4e2b3571a024bb437a242ac1337c0a201fc290f", "original": "동굴이 무너진다!!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "洞穴要塌了！！！", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 7, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 6, "value"], "target": "The cave is collapsing!!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "1ec92202d08fda687786cf9a18caaba9cd1a64ecbaf90d4f21212fb7511dc017", "original": "뭐라고!!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "什么！！！", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 8, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 7, "value"], "target": "What!!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "3f3d0f018fae3041f4b4d0831f818be9bc1ad28239b1b9cf87cffab468a6242c", "original": "모두들 조심해!!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "大家小心！！！", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 9, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 8, "value"], "target": "Everyone, watch out!!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "583021656d36e7500a88637271c15ab3ad58ce2983751ff8c40b748377b723f5", "original": "인페르노 지하채굴장", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "因弗诺地下矿场", "object_name": "art_fl02_te2", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6788305459229298327, "path": ["TextList", 10, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 50, "ops", 9, "value"], "target": "Inferno Underground Mine", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "b3d8921f79ce09fc117a005aa7b84c57265e64fc8385633399489345a909aa13", "original": "휴…/45d 이봐들,/20d 좀 더 힘들 내라구./35d/n이제 사이럽스까지 얼마 남지 않았어.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呼……/45d各位，/20d再加把劲。/35d/n离赛勒普斯已经不远了。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 0, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 0, "value"], "target": "Whew.../45d Come on, everyone,/20d keep going./35d/nWe're almost at Cyrups.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "e2f57ea683c3d4328d6ecf0c146b85f80ac6afbdf8acf31c64e03f605c993ea2", "original": "어이,/15d 새로 온 친구./20d/n트리시스 사막은 처음이라고 했던가?", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "喂，/15d新来的朋友。/20d/n你说这是第一次来特里西斯沙漠？", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 1, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 1, "value"], "target": "Hey,/15d new fellow./20d/nDid you say this was your first time in the Trisis Desert?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "176c9689827ef69988bd411eb9773971f4763dc96f2456435781b6fc933c5edc", "original": "그렇소이다.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "是的。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 2, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 2, "value"], "target": "That's right.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "142e68b35dbab5d98a98261630b0a32921934e1f0b5da2b3dd33046547522c6c", "original": "후후,/45d 트리시스 교역은/30d 빈손으로 시작해서/20d/n가장 크게 돈을 벌 수 있는 길이지만/45d/n사막이 처음인 사람은/30d 죽기 딱 좋은 방법이지.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呵呵，/45d跑特里西斯的贸易，/30d虽然是白手起家/20d/n赚大钱的最佳途径，/45d/n可对第一次进沙漠的人而言，/30d也最容易送命。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 3, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 3, "value"], "target": "Heh,/45d trading across Trisis/30d is the best way to start with nothing/20d/nand make a fortune./45d/nBut if you're new to the desert,/30d it's a fine way to get yourself killed.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "67667ba92c5e1ac0fa12d318ab45ad681ad484de64e06052e780c4212abf74a5", "original": "하,/40d 자네는 운이 좋았어./35d 횡단 교역을 주력으로 하는/30d/n우리 같은 장사꾼을 만날 수 있었으니 말이야.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "哈，/40d你运气不错。/35d能遇上我们这种/30d/n专门做横穿沙漠贸易的商人。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 4, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 4, "value"], "target": "Ha,/40d you're lucky./35d You found merchants like us/30d/nwho specialize in trade across the desert.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "0e9cd7712b3684359b82e3fb3d5247c96e599624811c46de59ec23a7cb9f0dbb", "original": "행여나/25d 쓸데없는 말로 체력을 낭비하진 말라구./55d/n도적이라도 만난다면/30d 죽을힘을 다해 뛰어야 할 테니까.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "可别/25d说些没用的话，白白浪费体力。/55d/n万一碰上盗贼，/30d还得拼命逃呢。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 5, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 5, "value"], "target": "Just/25d don't waste your strength on idle chatter./55d/nIf we run into bandits,/30d you'll have to run for your life.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "fb3607daa80fa4650b778b1a7afc8af96ba2b89338612cb3627c8446deef7780", "original": "사막 도적이라…", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "沙漠盗贼啊……", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 6, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 6, "value"], "target": "Desert bandits...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "dde4a20166bb3462efd8ce7c029f023fa4ae0075afddb4ee33966996e6829bf7", "original": "으악!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "啊！！", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 7, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 7, "value"], "target": "Aaargh!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "8c1ef9b9267597654042373876b43354c86aa2a485727faa291d86005b6993a7", "original": "도적떼다!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "是盗贼！！", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 9, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 8, "value"], "target": "Bandits!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "9996e746b7f5ab1e64b764868ceeda75c38cf6131432980ec0bc0801c49194d5", "original": "…/45d도망쳐라!!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "……/45d快逃！！", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 10, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 9, "value"], "target": ".../45dRun for your lives!!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "17e3ca156afa5f29cc8ef3443fda3837e6386720a9bb70b47c416f0d5e5d0119", "original": "이런…/45d 도망은 쳤지만 상인들까지 잃어버렸군./45d/n이제 어느 쪽으로 가야 할지…", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "糟了……/45d虽然逃了出来，却也和商人们走散了。/45d/n现在该往哪边走……", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 11, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 10, "value"], "target": "Damn.../45d I got away, but I've lost the merchants too./45d/nWhich way do I go now...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "83cd8dba03399fe321787e57b770fbcc7e5300d6a9caa504ff6056fd8add31a9", "original": "사이럽스는 남동쪽이었지./50d/n얼마 남지 않았다고 했으니/25d 일단 가보는 수밖에.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "赛勒普斯在东南方。/50d/n既然说已经不远，/25d也只能先往那边走了。", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 12, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 11, "value"], "target": "Cyrups was to the southeast./50d/nThey said it wasn't far,/25d so I'll just have to keep going.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "acf8d517087df2f1619e94291e1f6604d4bf6a81d43e4145f957019a948d7d2a", "original": "(…/50d역시/35d 초심자가 사막을 횡단하는 건 무리였나…/65d/n더 이상/10d 갈 수가…)", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "（……/50d果然，/35d新手想横穿沙漠还是太勉强了吗……/65d/n已经/10d走不动了……）", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 13, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 12, "value"], "target": "(.../50dWas/35d crossing the desert too much for a novice after all.../65d/nI can't/10d go any farther...)", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "3cfaa7abcb14d2d97dae8d665762eccd440cc2a849beb23c88b392722a8087b0", "original": "제 3 장", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "第三章", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 14, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 13, "value"], "target": "Chapter 3", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
{"id": "1db4691127dc96a146ffdfd40c7c9b7044e20c7e374db6147ee4817f0848f599", "original": "폭풍도를 향해서", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "向着风暴岛", "object_name": "art_fl03_s01", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-47185da1467218b32cbdb884ad62424c", "object_id": -6262186447245058764, "path": ["TextList", 15, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 9, "changes", 55, "ops", 14, "value"], "target": "Toward Storm Island", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean authoritative; Chinese checked as supporting context. Trisis and Storm Island remain provisional place names."]}
